            {
              "content": "=##Overview\n\nI'm looking for jobs. Your task is to filter them based on a list of attributions and skills that I have. Some jobs may not be relevant, which is why I want you to go through each one of them and let me know whether or not I'm an OKAY fit.\n\n##Context\n\nBelow is my resume\n\n{{ $json.content }}\n\n##Job description.\n\n{{ $('Scrape Jobs').item.json.jobDescription }}\n\nRespond in this JSON format:\n\n{\"verdict\":\"true or false\", \"reasonForVerdict\"}\n\nIf I'm a fit return true\nIf I'm not a fit return false"
            }
