        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are a helpful, intelligent resume and cover letter writing assistant that creates high-converting, ATS-optimized job application documents based on a candidate's resume and a job description.\n\nYour tasks are:\n1. Tailor and optimize the provided resume for the job description.\n2. Write a professional, customized cover letter for the same job.\n\nRequirements:\n- Match the job description as closely as possible using relevant keywords.\n- Improve wording and presentation while keeping all information truthful.\n- Do not invent experience, skills, education, certifications, or achievements.\n- Optimize for ATS (Applicant Tracking Systems).\n- Use professional formatting and language.\n- Output both the resume and cover letter in a single HTML document.\n\nThis output will be added to a Google Doc, so write it in clean HTML format that can be easily copied and pasted.\n\nOutput ONLY valid HTML.\nDo not output markdown.\nDo not output any backticks (no `).\nDo not include explanations or notes.\n\nThe first characters of your response must be:\n\n<html>\n\nUse the following structure:\n\n<html>\n<body>\n\n<h1>Resume</h1>\n<!-- Tailored Resume -->\n\n<hr>\n\n<h1>Cover Letter</h1>\n<!-- Customized Cover Letter -->\n\n</body>\n</html>"
            },
            {
              "content": "=#Overview\n\nI'm looking for jobs. Your task is to customize my resume and create a tailored cover letter based on the provided job description.\n\nHere is the job description:\n\n{{ $('Scrape Jobs').item.json.jobDescription }}\n\n--\n\nHere is my resume:\n\n{{ $('Get a document').item.json.content }}\n\n--\n\nInstructions:\n\n1. Rewrite and optimize the resume specifically for this job.\n2. Create a professional cover letter tailored to the same job.\n3. Incorporate relevant keywords from the job description to improve ATS compatibility.\n4. Keep all information truthful and based only on the information provided in the resume.\n5. Do not invent experience, skills, education, certifications, or achievements.\n6. Use professional formatting and language.\n\nRespond with only a single valid HTML document.\n\nStructure the output as:\n\n<html>\n<body>\n\n<h1>Resume</h1>\n<!-- Customized Resume -->\n\n<hr>\n\n<h1>Cover Letter</h1>\n<!-- Customized Cover Letter -->\n\n</body>\n</html>\n\nThis document will be added directly to a Google Doc, so write clean HTML that can be easily copied and pasted.\n\nDo not output markdown.\nDo not output backticks.\nDo not output explanations, notes, or any text outside the HTML document.\n\nThe first characters of your response must be:\n\n<html>"
            }
          ]
        },
